  "engine_commit": "c993a79",
  "fix": "Every free word run of every shortlisted window is now searched span by span with branch and bound: a span's score cannot exceed its parent's, so the search skips what cannot beat the best competitor yet and returns as soon as a span is admissible. A sliced ayah keeps its origin, so its words stay its own."
 },
